- item: watches (store label: luxury & formal), quantity 1; requirements: color family: green; case shape: rectangle; gender: female
- budget: at most 2750 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages to the shopper.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 moves.
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; offer no substitutes.
- rule from the request: Buy only items on hand, not distant listings.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item; view_listing show none; a listing's page (what a chain of pages or a page check means) is shown by view_listing

